                        <br />

                        <p>
                            In 2026, data analytics remains a top-tier career choice as organizations fully transition from digital adoption to total digital integration. With global data generation projected to exceed 180 zettabytes, companies are shifting away from intuition-based decisions toward mandatory, real-time insights powered by data.

