                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Product Analytics Manager:</b>
                                            <p style="margin-left:2%">
                                                Directs data-driven growth strategies for startups and digital platforms. 
                                            </p>
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </li>

                              
                            </ul>

                        </p>
                      
