                                <br />
                            </h5>
                            <br />
                            <p>
                                In 2025 and 2026, data analytics has become one of the most accessible high-growth career fields. Because it prioritizes logic and business understanding over heavy coding, it is open to a wide range of individuals across different educational and professional backgrounds.
